msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Hey, you're not from Okinawa, are you? Did you come here\r\n"
"from Tokyo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "I knew it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"I've never seen anyone from Okinawa wear expensive leather shoes with "
"pointy toes like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "...Can you really tell where I'm from just by my shoes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Never mind that! Anyway, I've always wanted to visit Tokyo!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"Maybe you could tell me about it? I'll get you something to\r\n"
"make up for it, promise!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Sorry, I'm a little busy right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"Well, come back when you're not, then! I'll be waiting\r\n"
"for you right around here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Sure, I guess I could spare a few minutes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"Yay! There's a bar I like right near here, so let's grab\r\n"
"some drinks and talk away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Please, I want to know more about Tokyo!"
msgstr ""

